145 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 111 0 R
/E (In a clinical context, a large miss is significantly more dangerous than several small ones. By squaring the residuals, we heavily penalize large discrepancies, forcing the model to be especially cautious with high-risk predictions.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
