/P 111 0 R
/E (Statistical Benchmarks With a mean progression of 152.1 and a standard deviation of 77.1, we have established a clear boundary. Any model worth its salt must achieve an error significantly lower than this standard deviation to prove it is providing actual clinical insight rather than just guessing the average.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
